{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_breeze_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_breeze_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"風暖寒林","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_breeze_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"34363da4ae8fc9a7d8cbb814536b7af635f99790c840970149fc2d8aa78bf816","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"个人剧情 微风"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"維多利亞西北邊境，森林的某處"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（總感覺有人一直在跟蹤我。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哼哼，看我的！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！這個腳印是——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雜食性的野獸，牙齒不是特別好。但它的爪子尖銳，通常把獵物撕成肉碎再吞入口中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平時不會攻擊人，可如果是冬季食物緊缺的情況......它們說不定會狩獵一些落單的人類......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚嗚啊啊啊 ——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾絲姐姐——！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚嗚嗚不要丟下我一個人啊！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然是麗塔啊，快過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾絲姐姐啊！！那邊的樹叢有動靜啊！！一定是野獸！我們是不是要死在這了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，別怕，那是我隨便想出來的啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就好奇是誰在後面鬼鬼祟祟地跟著我，原來是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾絲姐姐，不要嚇我啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然沒有這樣的野獸，但這樣偷偷跟出來也是很危險的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說吧，你為什麼跟蹤我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我、我餓了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為餓了，所以跟在我後面找食物？可我看你挺精神的呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸媽媽，沒有東西吃，他們把最後一點吃的給了我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"採集隊的食物呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽早就病了。自從爸爸打獵受傷後，採集隊的人就說我們家都是不出力的，就不願意分給我們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"採集隊的人說，現在是冬天，根本找不到食物。營地裡的儲備也不夠，除非突然暖和起來，不然食物只會越來越匱乏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（確實是這樣。情況越來越不好了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果救援再不來的話，到時候......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且......就算我跟著採集隊，我也沒什麼狩獵的貢獻。他們根本就不把東西分給我。所以，這幾天我就都沒去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們竟然這樣做？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......爸爸媽媽都躺在病床上，又冷，又填不飽肚子，好難受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾絲姐姐，可以告訴我有哪些是可以吃的嗎？我想採一點回去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就算是雜草也可以，很難吃也沒關係，只要能填飽肚子就好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題，包在我身上！不過，光吃路上能採到的這些還不夠，真正要吃飽，還要靠獸肉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡爬上爬下的，最後採到的食物，長期來看是不夠補償花費的力氣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是我，我抓不到野獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......今天沒辦法，就先應應急。等明天我帶你去北邊，試試看能不能抓到一些小型的獸類！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真的？謝謝格蕾絲姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，這樣爸爸媽媽也能吃飽了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先別急著謝，作為交換，今天你要乖乖聽話，不許亂跑，知道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"知道了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，小心腳下！別摔倒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們現在就來找能吃的野菜吧？爸爸媽媽還在等我帶吃的回去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這個植物長得好像野菜，格蕾絲姐姐，這個可以吃嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......這個雖然很像可食用的野菜，但其實是有毒性的啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃，那這邊這個呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個也不行，嚼不動的，還會讓口腔出血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那這個！這個果子！好鮮豔的，可以吃嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是瘤眼果，是一種長得很像瘤獸眼睛的漿果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是它不能吃哦。看起來很美味，而且吃進去以後也是甜甜的。但是呢，之後就會讓你開始拉肚子，只會越吃越乏力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞一些貴族會拿來當減肥藥使用，最終吃得自己精疲力竭，免疫力降低然後患上各種疾病......總之沒辦法吃飽，反而對人體有害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"靠讓別的物種拉肚子來播撒種子，真是有意思的進化方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚——那怎麼辦？！根本找不到能吃的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別擔心，雖然這果子不能吃，但它的葉子能吃。有點苦，但不會對人體造成什麼傷害。水煮，可以去掉一點苦味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我採一點點葉子好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼，看來我們運氣不錯！看我手裡，你還可以找點這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這不是石頭嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看這石頭上面，這是野生苔麥，上面的孢子就像麥穗一樣，是可以吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"書上說烏薩斯北原上的一些農民會種這種作物，沒想到這裡也有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太好了！我也採一點這個！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以多採一點。脫去外殼，然後洗一洗，可以煮成稀粥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是如果把這裡都採光了，之後不就沒得吃了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"苔麥收穫期很短的，過了收穫期，糖分被吸收，上方的孢子結構成型，作為“麥穗”的部分不再飽滿，口味變苦，無法入口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那現在的苔麥是好苔麥嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，麗塔運氣真的很好！不過畢竟是野生的苔麥，數量不多，把這些全採完才夠煮一鍋的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我努力一點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗塔真了不起，我也會一起幫忙的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝姐姐！嘿嘿，我要多採一些，然後偷偷藏起來，只給爸爸媽媽吃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等我把苔麥採了，就來幫格蕾絲姐姐一起採草藥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，那你就在這片平坦區域活動，不要走遠了。我去西邊的地方看看。有事喊我一聲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！麗塔聽姐姐的話！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（下雨了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（好冷，裸露的石頭變得好滑。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（該回去看看麗塔了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗塔————！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我——在——這——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（麗塔的聲音怎麼這麼遠？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗塔？？你在哪？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我——在——下——面——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我——不——小——心——滑——下——來——啦——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有沒有受傷？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別亂動啊！我馬上下來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐——姐——小——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_u_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，麗塔剛剛想說那邊很滑，讓姐姐小心別也踩著石頭滑到底下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個坑實在太滑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，姐姐頭上長出草了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢？你也要來一點嗎？嘿咻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！鬍子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈啾！哈——哈——哈啾！嗚......格蕾絲姐姐甩過來的葉子，黏到鼻子上了，好癢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗！你的鼻涕，鼻涕掛下來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲&麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，不笑你了。不過，你在這下面幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"上面找不到更多苔麥了，我看到下面還有，就想爬下來多採點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"結果一不小心滑了一跤！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"受傷了沒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是屁股著地有點疼，其他地方都沒問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，那我就放心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是答應我說要聽話的嗎，我可沒讓你來這裡啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是只夠煮一鍋也不太夠呀。而且萬一明天來採的時候已經過了收穫期，可不就全浪費了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也要注意自己的安全呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我的籃子也放上面了，所以不用擔心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才看到了，所以我也把籃子放那裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"靠著麗塔的籃子嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，靠著的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿嘿，真好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下雨了，來，把這個戴上，別著涼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好大的葉子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛摘的，戴在頭上，把你的角從這兩個洞洞裡鑽過去，可以擋雨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"耳朵涼涼的，感覺有點不舒服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要摘下來，淋雨的話會感冒的。如果你也病倒了，誰來照顧你的爸爸媽媽呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對，麗塔現在可是頂樑柱！我要好好地餵飽爸爸媽媽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐不戴大葉子嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗塔先戴著好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我很少淋雨，感覺還有點不一樣呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能，怎麼可能以前從來沒淋過雨呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞難道是一個不怎麼下雨的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在維多利亞，下雨是一件很常見的事情，但我真的很少淋雨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而如今，秋末的最後一場雨就這樣毫無阻攔地落在我的頭髮上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我比格蕾絲姐姐強！我經常在下雨天幫家裡收衣服，幹農活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"淋雨的感覺就和被村長訓差不多。就像這樣，麗塔噗噗，你怎麼噗噗這樣噗噗噗搗亂噗噗——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈，那個村長，的確激動起來會亂噴口水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是村長他現在噴不出來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他只是太老，又太累了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我都看到了，那天我偷偷跟著，看到格蕾絲姐姐把村長背出去，很吃力地帶到很遠的地方，剛剛放下沒多久，村長就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就像是燒木頭時飄起來的煙灰一樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的爸爸和媽媽會不會也變成那樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"求援的隊伍已經出發兩周，按照我畫的地圖，應該已經找到附近的城鎮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說，我今天採了那麼多草藥，麗塔也採了那麼多吃的，你的爸爸媽媽一定不會有事的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對哦！麗塔這麼努力，爸爸媽媽一定會好起來的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，姐姐為什麼不讓其他人幫忙採草藥呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......大家，其實也都像麗塔家一樣。現在吃都吃不飽，保障食物大概是大家目前最重要的事情吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以沒有人手來幫我啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雨也好像越來越大了，你的爸爸媽媽會擔心你的，你先回去好不好？我可以一個人把需要的草藥採完的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯！我要先把採到的這些帶回去了，爸爸媽媽一定也餓了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還認得回去的路嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當然認得！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我托你上去，小心點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿咻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"上來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那姐姐抓住我的手，我把你拉上來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈姐姐比你重太多啦，我可以自己爬上來的！姐姐這裡你放心好了，快回去照顧爸爸媽媽吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別跑太快！小心一點啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......接下來想想我自己的事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要用的草藥，剛剛之前看到了，就在那邊的山崖上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下雨了，這個坑對我來說倒不難爬，但那個山崖，我還上得去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好疼，剛才滑下來的時候腳踝的地方劃破了，傷口還挺大的，需要先止血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可那樣包紮完後會變得不靈活，就更難爬上山崖了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶！腳好痛啊......頭也有點暈暈的，是最近太累了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗塔的媽媽，情況很糟糕。她的爸爸受的是外傷，雖然做了緊急處理，但之後傷口仍有感染的風險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些貴族們不可能不知道有難民進入了領地啊，為什麼無動於衷......就算是驅逐......為什麼還不露面？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難民攜帶的醫療用品早就用完了，現在全靠我採到的草藥來進行簡單的治療，多採一點，就能多幫到一點忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望能撐到求援隊伍帶著人回來，希望能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不能胡思亂想了。等會雨變大就更難爬上那山崖了！必須趕快採到，下來後再包紮！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"維多利亞西北邊境，難民營地"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漢斯家的退燒藥，這個份量應該差不多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"彼得的牙疼藥，只能止疼......這點草藥好像有點不夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"驅蟲的藥......啊，怎麼少採了一種！一定是餓昏頭了。等會再出去採採看吧......外面已經暗下來了，雨也不小......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？我的營房門口怎麼有個人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞難民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾絲小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞難民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾絲小姐！！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來了！我在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞難民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾絲小姐，你才回來啊！有、有人好像突然生了很嚴重的病！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(不會又是和村長一樣的情況吧？)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在哪裡，快帶我去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞難民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"到了，就是這。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗塔家的營房？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗塔？你還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有回應......手掌燙傷得很嚴重，手臂上有淤青，後腦勺好腫。嗯......還有點發燒。明明之前還好好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是什麼時候發現她這樣的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞難民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"就剛才，大概二十分鐘前吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你來麗塔家做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞難民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她父母都在治療區內，這邊只有她一個人在給自己父母準備晚飯。你來她這幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞難民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我......因為她今天沒跟著採集隊出來，所以我就來看看怎麼回事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"撒謊！她說採集隊不給她食物，這幾天來她就沒跟過採集隊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的在意這個，早就應該來了，而不是現在才來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她今天採的食物呢？為什麼不在這個營房內？你是不是闖進來搶走了她的食物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞難民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞難民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我也只是為了讓我家人活下去而已！根本就沒多少食物了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞難民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"誰知道......她反抗得這麼厲害......誰知道......她就這樣了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞的貴族不會不管的。我們派出去求援的隊伍應該也差不多到附近城鎮了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞難民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"就算您說的是真的，在這之前我的孩子們就會受不了的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也不至於，去搶一個小女孩的食物！這是她自己努力採集來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她手掌上的燙傷，是因為怕你要搶，所以直接用手抱住滾燙的湯鍋而導致的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她手臂上的淤青，也是你抓的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後腦勺，也是被你推開後撞到了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞難民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我又......不是故意要讓她受傷的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞難民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"她的父母已經不行了！就算她活下來又能怎樣？到時候也就只是一個......孤兒！就算一切好起來，她也沒法獨自活下去的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞難民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我的孩子們，我還算健康！我們能整個家庭活下來，要比她這樣來得重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎，在你的眼裡，生命有輕重之分......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我呢，我的命，在你眼裡有多重？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們似乎一直都在觀察著我與我的悼詞，小聲地討論著我的身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請你告訴我，我的這條命，在你眼裡有多重？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞難民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"大、大人！您給我們治病，救了我們，有人猜您應該是維多利亞的貴族......您是我們這裡最尊貴的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你是不是應該把你的食物交給我，好讓我活下去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是——很久沒好好地吃一頓了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞難民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"......這......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你不願意把食物給我，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你根本就不是在以什麼邏輯，什麼道理，什麼正確性來行事。你只是自私。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我討厭自私鬼，更不會幫助強盜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看在你至少還把這件事報告給我的份上，再給你一次機會——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把食物還回來，一點也不准少！如果吃了，就補上！不然我保證，救援隊伍的車上不會有你的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞難民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"是......好的，大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，原來我也能那麼自然地說那種嚇唬人的謊話。算了，有用就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗塔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"營養不良，發燒，外傷，炎症。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這份已經配好的退燒藥，先給麗塔用吧。如果不夠，等會再去採一點給治療區的病人送去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......不要搶走我爸爸媽媽的湯......！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗塔！是我，格蕾絲。我只是借一下你的湯鍋，熬藥給你吃，不要害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等會服下這些湯劑，你就會感覺好一點的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸媽媽的......食物......被......搶走了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，食物會回來的。你現在要相信姐姐，好好休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，我已經幫你吹涼了，麗塔，稍微把嘴張開一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗塔很棒！嘴角有點流出來了，我幫你擦一擦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"過會就會起效的，你先在這裡睡一會。我去幫你拿點別的藥來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼——呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經睡著了嗎，藥效真快啊。乖乖等著我，我馬上就回來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好大的雨啊......真暗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要快一點，再晚一點就什麼也看不見了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"腿好疼啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得我要找的草藥就在這附近......箭形的葉片，上面有細密的鋸齒。啊！是這個嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！洗完了，把這些磨成粉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼一用力就暈暈的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請再堅持一會！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，這些草藥的配比。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，柴火不夠了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溫度......我需要再去拾點柴火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗塔，麗塔，不要害怕，我現在要餵你一些湯劑，可能稍微會有點......燙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我好像忘記把草藥的籽挑出來了......可能還會很苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外敷的藥已經給你貼上了。這是消炎的湯劑，喝下去，你會很快好起來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會讓你出事的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（吃力地吞咽）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘻嘻，麗塔真乖呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好暈......不行了......我、稍微休息一下？......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"麗塔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"麗塔......麗塔......一定要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們發現她的時候已經這樣了，嘴裡一直在念著這個名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"全身是泥巴，腿部有創傷，以及輕微的礦石病感染症狀，是剛感染不久嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"礦石病感染也是原因之一，但主要還是因為饑餓與極度疲憊才暈倒的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"據說已經暈了有好幾天了。一些難民們說是這小姑娘保護了他們。如果沒有她的努力，不可能有這麼多人活下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"難民因為康復後仍有勞動力，可以拜託萊塔尼亞的古爾克先生為他們提供治療與住所。他需要人手來維護他那個奇怪的城堡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這些人的家鄉受災嚴重，現在歸鄉不太可能，所以大多數難民都接受了這個提議，準備先在古爾克那接受治療，再看情況要不要回鄉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也只有像讓難民回自己國家這樣的正當理由，相關的貴族才不會從中阻撓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那個叫麗塔的小女孩，她的母親已經離世，幸好她殘疾的父親還能繼續提供一點勞動力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"聽附近的天災信使說羅德島本艦上的地靈小姐與古爾克是舊識，我會寫信讓她幫忙求求情，好讓這對父女能被納入他的領地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刀片般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沃爾珀小姑娘的野路子令人印象深刻，但只是採點草藥，懂點臨床理論，是無法抑制她自己的礦石病的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刀片般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她把救助難民這件事看得太單純。想得過於簡單，遲早會要了她的命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刀片般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等會幫我聯繫一下附近的信使，我要寄兩封信，一封給羅德島，另一封送到多倫郡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我必須提醒您，維多利亞有貴族為了爭奪領地，需要這些難民死在這裡。為了保險起見，我們現在明面上不能代表羅德島。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"尤其您還是從維多利亞的醫學研討會上溜出來的，行動必須低調，最好不要節外生枝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刀片般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"原來我參加的是學術研討會啊。這幾天下來我還以為參加的是什麼杜林族模仿愛好者舉辦的品酒會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刀片般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼，對於一些貴族來說，人道主義的光輝是一種潮流，也僅僅是潮流而已。權衡利弊，他們早就做出意料之內的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她太虛弱了。不立刻治療的話會更多病症會趁虛而入，礦石病的感染也會加速。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刀片般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"讓她以我助手的身份在維多利亞接受最好的治療。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刀片般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當然我們的真實身份也會一直對她保密，這樣不就行了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"助手？我看您是還想把她帶在身邊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刀片般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我可不是什麼撐著傘從天而降的維多利亞保姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刀片般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等她康復後，我會聯繫專業的地方讓她進修醫療技藝，而我還有別的事要做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刀片般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她如果想繼續她天真的事業，我也沒有什麼意見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刀片般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是她作為醫者得了礦石病，沒得選，總不能繼續當一個野路子。至少，她需要學會怎麼保護自己。至於她未來會怎樣是她自己的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"隨您吧。唉，不過等Scout先生現在的任務完成後，我就要調去他的小隊了。有個維多利亞的本地人在你身邊管您一段時間也好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可憐的小沃爾珀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刀片般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她在治療病人的時候，可比你果決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，而且她的藥方在治療非礦石病的病人時，也非常有效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我大概明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"善良、堅強、正直，年紀輕輕卻如此有水準。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您想保護一種可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我也......真想看看她以後的樣子。可惜她醒來之前我應該就已經返程去羅德島了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"勇敢的小沃爾珀，你一定要早點好起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還有更多的人在等著你——我也會等待著你的成長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過現在的你應該聽不到吧......哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也想看到你的未來，小沃爾珀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖陽般的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果我們有緣，以後還會見面的，也許在羅德島，也許在別的什麼地方......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
